WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:20.270
Chune!

2
00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:24.566
Chune…

3
00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:33.366
<i>I forgot about the doctor's appointment.</i>
<i>See you soon.</i>

4
00:00:34.075 --> 00:00:35.535
What the…

5
00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.084
Capets

6
00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:57.432
<i>This is how I think since childhood.</i>

7
00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:02.145
<i>There is a certain amount of happiness in life.</i>

8
00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:07.192
Not bad.

9
00:01:25.794 --> 00:01:26.628
What?

10
00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:32.467
But what is it?

11
00:01:33.468 --> 00:01:35.220
Well, let it.

12
00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:39.557
It doesn't matter if it takes you where you need to go.

13
00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:44.979
<i>In other words,</i>

14
00:01:46.231 --> 00:01:48.900
<i>there is a certain amount of unhappiness.</i>

15
00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.030
What? What's going on?

16
00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:57.534
It can't be!

17
00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:00.620
No. go

18
00:02:23.059 --> 00:02:25.395
{\an8}COOKED CORN

19
00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:27.480
<i>Everything is simple.</i>

20
00:02:28.523 --> 00:02:31.359
<i>If someone is going through a series of difficulties,</i>

21
00:02:33.194 --> 00:02:36.573
<i>one can hope</i>
<i>that something good will happen soon.</i>

22
00:02:38.116 --> 00:02:40.160
And let I was hungry anyway.

23
00:02:40.702 --> 00:02:43.163
I will eat corn and rest.

24
00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:49.252
Where did you find this old can?

25
00:02:51.546 --> 00:02:52.922
It will continue to break.

26
00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:56.176
Get rid of this car and buy a new one.

27
00:02:57.677 --> 00:02:58.845
Will still serve.

28
00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:01.806
Can you check the wipers?

29
00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:03.349
They turn on when they want.

30
00:03:03.433 --> 00:03:05.435
I will be grateful if you fix it.

31
00:03:15.987 --> 00:03:16.905
And now what?

32
00:03:19.324 --> 00:03:21.242
STONES ARE FALLING
THE ROAD IS CLOSED

33
00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:32.712
{\an8}ROUTE 101 DEtour

34
00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:43.556
So what? Lately
I don't do much sports.

35
00:03:47.685 --> 00:03:52.357
<i>It's like self-suggestion, and it works.</i>

36
00:03:52.857 --> 00:03:55.109
{\an8}CHEONHYE MEMORIAL PARK

37
00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:57.904
<i>If I didn't think so,</i>

38
00:03:59.489 --> 00:04:01.783
<i>I probably wouldn't be able to stand it.</i>

39
00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:04.661
I'm alone again.

40
00:04:06.996 --> 00:04:08.665
Did you have a fight with Chun?

41
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.418
It seems he doesn't want to see you

42
00:04:13.127 --> 00:04:15.338
because you made him suffer.

43
00:04:17.548 --> 00:04:19.592
<i>When my life hit rock bottom...</i>

44
00:04:27.517 --> 00:04:30.770
<i>I would have easily given up if it weren't for that.</i>

45
00:04:32.188 --> 00:04:33.189
I'll go now.

46
00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:36.901
I probably won't come either.

47
00:04:40.488 --> 00:04:42.991
To be honest, I don't remember much.

48
00:04:44.075 --> 00:04:45.326
I have nothing to say.

49
00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:48.371
Chun and I are fine.

50
00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:51.874
Don't worry about us.

51
00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:57.463
<i>That's why I decided to believe it.</i>

52
00:05:11.394 --> 00:05:13.896
It's time for something good.

53
00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:20.403
What the…

54
00:05:24.824 --> 00:05:26.909
This is the day today.

55
00:05:27.744 --> 00:05:28.703
Such

56
00:05:30.038 --> 00:05:32.415
What? Why is it not working again?

57
00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:34.167
God

58
00:05:52.518 --> 00:05:53.353
This is…

59
00:05:56.689 --> 00:05:59.108
What's wrong?

60
00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:01.694
How…

61
00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:26.552
what are you doing here

62
00:06:30.723 --> 00:06:33.059
Need to fix something?

63
00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:37.980
<i>If you have experienced difficulties...</i>

64
00:06:38.064 --> 00:06:39.232
hold on

65
00:06:55.665 --> 00:06:56.666
- You...
- Why is this...

66
00:07:00.586 --> 00:07:03.923
<i>…it means that only happiness is ahead.</i>

67
00:07:08.261 --> 00:07:09.345
You fixed it.

68
00:07:09.429 --> 00:07:10.888
It looks like that.

69
00:07:23.693 --> 00:07:30.700
EPISODE 4
IT'S NOT YOUR FAULT

70
00:07:37.373 --> 00:07:39.208
What is your goal, Mr. Ko?

71
00:07:40.418 --> 00:07:45.006
Are you interested in fame or money?

72
00:07:45.965 --> 00:07:49.385
Recently your articles
the most popular in our magazine.

73
00:07:50.386 --> 00:07:52.805
Your texts are quite cynical.

74
00:07:53.764 --> 00:07:56.934
Easy to read, but sharp,
they are listened to.

75
00:07:57.935 --> 00:08:00.521
Want to become a famous critic?

76
00:08:02.273 --> 00:08:04.859
A famous critic? Is there such a position?

77
00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:07.445
I can help.

78
00:08:07.987 --> 00:08:10.406
You can become the main critic of the magazine.

79
00:08:11.449 --> 00:08:13.367
It's time for fresh faces.

80
00:08:15.661 --> 00:08:18.414
I thought a critic's job was to write reviews.

81
00:08:18.498 --> 00:08:21.250
We can take you to the media space.

82
00:08:22.001 --> 00:08:26.172
That is, on television,
YouTube and radio programs,

83
00:08:26.255 --> 00:08:29.383
you will be the most beautiful
modern film critic.

84
00:08:29.467 --> 00:08:33.054
Not like blogger Goddam,
and as Ko Geum, a film critic.

85
00:08:37.183 --> 00:08:38.935
But I like it as it is.

86
00:08:39.727 --> 00:08:44.232
Then more people will read
your articles and will trust your opinion.

87
00:08:44.815 --> 00:08:46.817
You will have more influence.

88
00:08:47.485 --> 00:08:51.197
And of course, you will earn more.

89
00:08:54.867 --> 00:08:56.035
As far as?

90
00:08:57.787 --> 00:08:58.621
Lot.

91
00:09:00.623 --> 00:09:01.457
A lot…

92
00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:04.377
This is a great opportunity for you.

93
00:09:04.919 --> 00:09:08.673
Work as conscientiously as
but I am open to something more provocative.

94
00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:11.801
What movie is next?

95
00:09:12.385 --> 00:09:16.180
I plan to watch a new movie
directed by Koo Yeon-sik.

96
00:09:49.422 --> 00:09:51.424
THE YOUNG DIRECTOR WANTS UNIVERSALITY

97
00:09:56.637 --> 00:09:58.264
And he writes well.

98
00:09:59.056 --> 00:10:02.602
No, it's all me.
I gave him good answers to work with.

99
00:10:07.231 --> 00:10:10.651
I knew that. He writes reviews
for all films except mine.

100
00:10:12.194 --> 00:10:14.030
Think you're that cool?

101
00:10:44.268 --> 00:10:45.770
The movie is really not about me.

102
00:10:45.853 --> 00:10:46.687
"TWO SEASONS"

103
00:11:04.747 --> 00:11:05.998
Did I come early?

104
00:11:07.375 --> 00:11:09.001
Maybe he's still sleeping.

105
00:11:36.278 --> 00:11:37.279
He scared me!

106
00:11:37.863 --> 00:11:39.740
Where did he go so early?

107
00:12:02.805 --> 00:12:03.639
who are you

108
00:12:06.308 --> 00:12:07.643
Didn't I come there?

109
00:12:08.227 --> 00:12:09.854
I must have made a mistake.

110
00:12:09.937 --> 00:12:11.230
Be there.

111
00:12:18.654 --> 00:12:19.488
Who was it?

112
00:12:19.572 --> 00:12:21.574
I don't mind. They made a mistake with the address.

113
00:12:21.657 --> 00:12:23.826
- When did you arrive?
- Just now.

114
00:12:24.535 --> 00:12:26.412
where have you been all morning

115
00:12:26.954 --> 00:12:28.456
I fell asleep while waiting.

116
00:12:29.957 --> 00:12:32.209
I went to the cinema.

117
00:12:32.877 --> 00:12:36.630
You've never done this before.
No inspiration to write songs?

118
00:12:38.299 --> 00:12:39.759
I liked the last song.

119
00:12:39.842 --> 00:12:41.218
can i sing

120
00:12:41.927 --> 00:12:42.762
listen

121
00:12:43.637 --> 00:12:45.556
You don't need to take care of me.

122
00:12:46.891 --> 00:12:49.643
didn't think
that your confidence will be shaken.

123
00:12:50.269 --> 00:12:53.314
I liked you more
when he was arrogant for no reason.

124
00:12:55.441 --> 00:12:57.443
Get up. Let's go record a song.

125
00:13:06.118 --> 00:13:07.870
Are you a fanatic?

126
00:13:10.956 --> 00:13:12.583
A fanatic in free fall.

127
00:13:13.167 --> 00:13:15.628
Enough to consider. Let's play games.

128
00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:18.714
- Can I borrow some books?
- Of course.

129
00:13:18.798 --> 00:13:21.467
Or you can read here
and stay the night.

130
00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:22.551
Not at all.

131
00:13:29.934 --> 00:13:31.769
Sir, do you have a daughter?

132
00:13:31.852 --> 00:13:35.105
And what? I don't look like someone who has a family?

133
00:13:35.189 --> 00:13:38.442
you never talked about your family
so i thought

134
00:13:38.943 --> 00:13:41.195
that you are a fanatic who lives alone.

135
00:13:41.904 --> 00:13:43.447
This is also true.

136
00:13:43.531 --> 00:13:44.949
Do you live separately?

137
00:13:45.032 --> 00:13:48.369
Who wants to live with me
when I'm constantly shooting movies?

138
00:13:49.161 --> 00:13:50.079
I'm miserable.

139
00:13:51.121 --> 00:13:53.958
It's hard to be miserable
sitting in an expensive massage chair.

140
00:13:54.959 --> 00:13:57.086
Things are worthless.

141
00:13:58.170 --> 00:13:59.630
Live life wisely.

142
00:14:01.423 --> 00:14:04.760
By the way, why don't you write anything
on your blog?

143
00:14:05.427 --> 00:14:07.179
I liked the older posts better.

144
00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:10.474
Professionals write when they are paid.

145
00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:12.810
And this is a professional review?

146
00:14:13.978 --> 00:14:18.524
Your latest reviews are borderline.
Aren't you too sharp?

147
00:14:18.607 --> 00:14:22.236
I'm only harsh with bad movies
and not with the good ones.

148
00:14:22.319 --> 00:14:27.199
Film critics and directors -
mortal enemies.

149
00:14:27.867 --> 00:14:30.703
Don't make your enemies hate you
even more It's tiring.

150
00:14:32.288 --> 00:14:35.708
We are just doing our job.
Don't take it personally.

151
00:14:35.791 --> 00:14:39.628
When dealing with people
not everything is so simple.

152
00:14:40.671 --> 00:14:42.506
What do you have there?

153
00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:45.801
My brother loves them.
How do I get them home?

154
00:14:47.595 --> 00:14:51.348
It would be much easier
if someone else were here.

155
00:14:52.516 --> 00:14:55.603
Do you want to kick me out of my own house?

156
00:14:59.857 --> 00:15:02.860
Sir, maybe next time
bring your brother here?

157
00:15:02.943 --> 00:15:04.403
Anyway, whatever.

158
00:15:05.112 --> 00:15:07.489
When you talk about him, you are like a child.

159
00:15:09.241 --> 00:15:12.286
OK, I'll stay with you for another two hours.

160
00:15:12.369 --> 00:15:13.621
Yes!

161
00:15:13.704 --> 00:15:15.623
- Get up.
- Yes!

162
00:15:17.082 --> 00:15:18.000
OK.

163
00:15:20.586 --> 00:15:22.254
We need to close the blinds.

164
00:15:26.133 --> 00:15:28.385
ESSENTIAL REVIEWS OF MR. GODAM

165
00:15:38.604 --> 00:15:42.358
There is more and more arrogance in his texts.

166
00:15:42.441 --> 00:15:43.275
OK.

167
00:15:45.736 --> 00:15:47.905
Song Chu Ah is already leaving.

168
00:15:47.988 --> 00:15:50.407
When she arrives, take her to the conference room.

169
00:15:50.491 --> 00:15:51.325
Good.

170
00:15:52.534 --> 00:15:55.120
An invitation has been sent
for a preview.

171
00:15:56.163 --> 00:15:58.499
I don't know if I will have time.

172
00:15:59.166 --> 00:16:00.167
Whose movie?

173
00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.294
Directed by Koo Yeon Sik.

174
00:16:05.547 --> 00:16:06.465
Truth?

175
00:16:09.468 --> 00:16:10.803
{\an8}CONFERENCE HALL AND LOUNGE

176
00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.814
I agree to make a movie.

177
00:16:23.232 --> 00:16:24.566
Can you really make it?

178
00:16:25.526 --> 00:16:28.362
I don't know, but it's worth a try.

179
00:16:29.279 --> 00:16:30.364
And that's all?

180
00:16:31.615 --> 00:16:35.452
The script reminds me of "La La Land"
and even Start Again.

181
00:16:35.536 --> 00:16:38.288
And "The Birth of a Star" comes to mind.

182
00:16:38.872 --> 00:16:40.249
Is it a mixture of everything?

183
00:16:40.332 --> 00:16:44.211
But it's an original story, and that's what matters.

184
00:16:44.294 --> 00:16:46.880
Universal, but unfamiliar.

185
00:16:46.964 --> 00:16:49.550
Stories about love and achieving dreams
sell well.

186
00:16:50.134 --> 00:16:53.554
You need a better reason
to make a movie?

187
00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:58.392
Your vision is too simplistic
I am worried

188
00:16:59.893 --> 00:17:02.938
you already know
that this story is important to me

189
00:17:03.897 --> 00:17:05.983
I hope you will turn it into a good movie.

190
00:17:07.568 --> 00:17:09.778
Even a heartwarming story
may fail

191
00:17:09.862 --> 00:17:12.781
and the story that does not care
could be a hit.

192
00:17:13.699 --> 00:17:14.950
I promise nothing.

193
00:17:16.035 --> 00:17:17.911
Our visions do not coincide.

194
00:17:19.872 --> 00:17:22.207
Do you know that music is very important?

195
00:17:22.291 --> 00:17:23.125
I know

196
00:17:23.625 --> 00:17:24.960
Can I advise you?

197
00:17:25.044 --> 00:17:27.629
It is possible, but I will decide.

198
00:17:27.713 --> 00:17:28.547
Good.

199
00:17:40.893 --> 00:17:44.396
Why is it so difficult for this family
get together for lunch on the weekend?

200
00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:46.398
Everyone is very busy.

201
00:17:47.107 --> 00:17:49.193
Is there a lot of work at the hospital?

202
00:17:49.276 --> 00:17:51.987
I have everything as usual. What about you?

203
00:17:52.071 --> 00:17:55.741
He has been busy lately
clinical trials.

204
00:17:55.824 --> 00:17:57.493
- At what stage are you?
- The third.

205
00:17:58.035 --> 00:17:59.453
It's almost over.

206
00:18:14.426 --> 00:18:15.260
take it

207
00:18:15.344 --> 00:18:17.888
take away I don't need to.

208
00:18:19.473 --> 00:18:20.307
Si Chun.

209
00:18:22.184 --> 00:18:25.354
Mom and Dad waited a long time.
come back home

210
00:18:28.357 --> 00:18:30.859
- I will take care of myself.
- Obviously not.

211
00:18:35.739 --> 00:18:38.242
You yourself said that music is just a hobby.

212
00:18:38.325 --> 00:18:41.203
And you gave up everything to live like this?

213
00:18:41.286 --> 00:18:44.081
You think you are very cool
in your 20s?

214
00:18:44.957 --> 00:18:47.918
Give up everything for music -
it's a bit selfish.

215
00:18:48.544 --> 00:18:50.462
But you didn't give up everything.

216
00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.924
- What?
- Tell me, what did you give up?

217
00:18:54.633 --> 00:18:56.635
Mom pays for the studio rent.

218
00:18:56.718 --> 00:18:59.471
When you come home for lunch
they give you money

219
00:18:59.972 --> 00:19:03.600
you do whatever you want
because you have somewhere to return to.

220
00:19:06.395 --> 00:19:08.981
You should have achieved something by now.

221
00:19:09.064 --> 00:19:10.732
And if you haven't achieved anything yet...

222
00:19:14.653 --> 00:19:18.323
Xi Chun, how much more do we have
blindly believe in you?

223
00:19:20.659 --> 00:19:21.577
Brother

224
00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.248
What faith are you talking about?

225
00:19:27.916 --> 00:19:28.750
What?

226
00:19:28.834 --> 00:19:32.004
Has anyone ever believed in me?

227
00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:58.071
It's really you!

228
00:19:58.155 --> 00:19:59.531
what are you doing

229
00:20:00.157 --> 00:20:02.492
I don't think this is my place.

230
00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.078
sit down They're about to start.

231
00:20:05.162 --> 00:20:08.582
Thanks for coming to the preview.

232
00:20:08.665 --> 00:20:10.209
I'm Yoo Yong Hyun and I will…

233
00:20:10.292 --> 00:20:13.212
We are watching a movie together for the second time.

234
00:20:13.295 --> 00:20:17.132
...you will meet
with director Koo Yeon-sik and the cast.

235
00:20:23.805 --> 00:20:28.143
Congratulations. I'm Koo Yeon-sik, the director of this movie.

236
00:20:28.977 --> 00:20:33.315
The movie is… not too serious and not deep.

237
00:20:33.398 --> 00:20:36.777
My movies are rather…

238
00:20:40.364 --> 00:20:41.406
Thank you

239
00:20:43.242 --> 00:20:44.660
Shall we have dinner?

240
00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:48.830
I showed you indulgence
but don't act like it.

241
00:20:48.914 --> 00:20:51.500
What's wrong with the family having dinner together?

242
00:20:51.583 --> 00:20:53.168
what family

243
00:20:53.252 --> 00:20:55.003
Neighbors are like family.

244
00:20:55.087 --> 00:20:58.674
Don't talk nonsense and stay away.

245
00:20:58.757 --> 00:20:59.883
Got it?

246
00:21:01.093 --> 00:21:02.928
Good for you!

247
00:21:19.695 --> 00:21:23.282
He accepted it too quickly.

248
00:21:36.545 --> 00:21:37.379
Something wrong?

249
00:21:38.672 --> 00:21:39.923
What happened?

250
00:21:42.676 --> 00:21:44.011
You can not say.

251
00:21:46.555 --> 00:21:47.431
San Siku,

252
00:21:48.181 --> 00:21:50.100
how many years have I been working here?

253
00:21:50.183 --> 00:21:52.686
Let's count.

254
00:21:53.186 --> 00:21:54.771
Six years...

255
00:21:57.691 --> 00:22:01.903
Are you going to ask for more money again?

256
00:22:01.987 --> 00:22:05.824
I gave you a big bonus last time.
are you serious

257
00:22:05.907 --> 00:22:08.702
It was supposed to be a temporary job.
And already so long?

258
00:22:10.579 --> 00:22:13.790
Are you having problems now?

259
00:22:14.416 --> 00:22:15.250
I think…

260
00:22:17.544 --> 00:22:18.712
that I'm miserable

261
00:22:18.795 --> 00:22:21.298
Don't call yourself pathetic.

262
00:22:21.798 --> 00:22:23.967
You thought it was easy to be an artist?

263
00:22:26.011 --> 00:22:28.972
I'll take out the trash for you today.

264
00:22:29.056 --> 00:22:32.934
I think you're fine.

265
00:22:34.227 --> 00:22:36.063
- You are well done.
- What uncle?

266
00:22:36.146 --> 00:22:37.314
- Enough.
- Look at yourself.

267
00:22:37.397 --> 00:22:38.982
A sad face does not suit you.

268
00:22:39.066 --> 00:22:42.736
Let's drink something with ice.

269
00:22:43.236 --> 00:22:44.237
Good?

270
00:22:45.238 --> 00:22:46.782
- Of course.
- Make drinks.

271
00:23:03.548 --> 00:23:04.716
Listen, Honsey.

272
00:23:06.385 --> 00:23:09.012
A blind date. I forgot about the date!

273
00:23:09.721 --> 00:23:10.555
What?

274
00:23:10.639 --> 00:23:13.183
You can pack up and go home.
I will go first.

275
00:23:13.266 --> 00:23:15.394
I thought we would have a drink.

276
00:23:16.103 --> 00:23:21.191
drink whatever
just close the door when you leave. bye

277
00:23:21.691 --> 00:23:23.735
Seriously?

278
00:23:27.447 --> 00:23:28.949
A blind date, anyway.

279
00:23:33.829 --> 00:23:36.498
What's the rush? Forgot something?

280
00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:46.258
Will you drink with me?

281
00:23:54.975 --> 00:23:57.018
Don't you want to drink with me?

282
00:23:57.102 --> 00:23:59.396
No, I don't want to spoil the drink.

283
00:24:00.605 --> 00:24:03.608
I asked to pass by.
why did you come

284
00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:07.821
The last meeting was unexpected,

285
00:24:07.904 --> 00:24:10.157
and we didn't have a chance to talk...

286
00:24:10.240 --> 00:24:11.324
Get to the point.

287
00:24:22.669 --> 00:24:24.254
do you want me back

288
00:24:25.213 --> 00:24:27.424
Do you want to be friends?

289
00:24:27.966 --> 00:24:28.800
Hong Si Chun.

290
00:24:28.884 --> 00:24:30.135
I'm against it.

291
00:24:31.511 --> 00:24:32.345
Got it?

292
00:24:34.306 --> 00:24:35.223
Now go.

293
00:24:48.361 --> 00:24:51.781
You don't listen as usual. It's annoying.

294
00:24:54.242 --> 00:24:56.578
Five years ago I was screaming and crying

295
00:24:57.245 --> 00:25:00.665
and begged to take me back
or at least stay friends.

296
00:25:02.083 --> 00:25:04.419
You are the same now as you were then.

297
00:25:06.421 --> 00:25:09.925
- You are not the only one who suffered.
- Yes, of course.

298
00:25:10.967 --> 00:25:12.928
But what is the point in this?

299
00:25:13.011 --> 00:25:15.180
I don't feel anything for you.

300
00:25:21.853 --> 00:25:23.855
And if that's not why I'm here?

301
00:25:27.776 --> 00:25:30.695
I'm not here to
to get you back or be friends

302
00:25:31.696 --> 00:25:32.531
What?

303
00:25:33.990 --> 00:25:35.367
I wrote about us.

304
00:25:35.992 --> 00:25:36.910
What did you write?

305
00:25:36.993 --> 00:25:40.455
As you said, I was desperate
and drew inspiration everywhere.

306
00:25:40.997 --> 00:25:42.082
I wrote about us.

307
00:25:48.046 --> 00:25:52.300
I want to make a movie, but I need you.

308
00:25:54.219 --> 00:25:57.722
I believed in you these seven years so
like no other.

309
00:26:00.475 --> 00:26:05.063
I loved your music more than anyone
and now I need it.

310
00:26:10.986 --> 00:26:12.904
I really need your music.

311
00:26:41.182 --> 00:26:43.018
Did you get to the hospital without any problems?

312
00:26:43.518 --> 00:26:46.271
Yes, of course.

313
00:26:48.106 --> 00:26:51.484
Probably overworked a little. Shoulders hurt.

314
00:26:51.568 --> 00:26:55.864
Really? i thought
the appointment was yesterday, not today.

315
00:26:56.781 --> 00:26:58.992
Yes. I was there yesterday.

316
00:26:59.909 --> 00:27:02.162
It still hurts since yesterday.

317
00:27:02.245 --> 00:27:03.538
It was today.

318
00:27:07.292 --> 00:27:10.962
Chun, I got a call from the hospital today.

319
00:27:11.046 --> 00:27:14.382
They say you're late
you don't come and it's strange

320
00:27:14.466 --> 00:27:17.469
because you said you went there
when I went to visit my parents.

321
00:27:18.261 --> 00:27:20.096
Simple

322
00:27:20.180 --> 00:27:22.766
I felt bad

323
00:27:22.849 --> 00:27:25.101
and went for a walk around the block...

324
00:27:25.185 --> 00:27:26.770
Think you've recovered?

325
00:27:26.853 --> 00:27:30.440
It's hard for you to even walk.
Why are you missing sessions?

326
00:27:31.399 --> 00:27:33.985
I'm better now. And you know it.

327
00:27:34.069 --> 00:27:36.071
In this condition

328
00:27:36.154 --> 00:27:38.907
just walking is enough...

329
00:27:38.990 --> 00:27:41.826
Are you a doctor now?
Who said you decide?

330
00:27:43.244 --> 00:27:45.997
Treatment is too expensive.

331
00:27:46.081 --> 00:27:48.166
I don't care. Continue

332
00:27:49.292 --> 00:27:50.877
What do you care?

333
00:27:50.960 --> 00:27:54.923
I am invited to various shows,
and my earnings increased significantly.

334
00:27:55.507 --> 00:27:56.966
Expensive, yes.

335
00:27:57.050 --> 00:28:00.470
I can pay double or triple
so don't miss it.

336
00:28:02.097 --> 00:28:03.431
Good, good.

337
00:28:05.850 --> 00:28:10.271
You just raised your voice at me
because you are the breadwinner now?

338
00:28:11.022 --> 00:28:11.981
Sadly.

339
00:28:13.066 --> 00:28:14.984
When I got the call, I thought:

340
00:28:15.068 --> 00:28:18.530
"It sounds like a teacher calling from school."

341
00:28:19.406 --> 00:28:20.740
Do not miss sessions.

342
00:28:23.493 --> 00:28:24.411
I heard you.

343
00:28:43.263 --> 00:28:46.516
<i>I have high hopes</i>
<i>on the Korean film industry.</i>

344
00:28:46.599 --> 00:28:48.768
<i>Take Kim Yoo Chin's new movie...</i>

345
00:28:48.852 --> 00:28:50.019
What?

346
00:28:50.103 --> 00:28:52.021
<i>- The film is good.</i>
- What is he doing?

347
00:28:53.064 --> 00:28:54.566
<i>It was a positive view...</i>

348
00:28:54.649 --> 00:28:57.318
It's amazing. What is he, a celebrity?

349
00:28:57.986 --> 00:28:59.738
Why is he on TV?

350
00:29:01.990 --> 00:29:04.075
I saw this young man somewhere.

351
00:29:05.410 --> 00:29:07.287
Does he live opposite?

352
00:29:08.204 --> 00:29:09.205
Is he famous?

353
00:29:09.289 --> 00:29:10.874
Absolutely not.

354
00:29:10.957 --> 00:29:14.419
Anyone is invited to these shows.
I can go too.

355
00:29:14.502 --> 00:29:16.004
He can speak.

356
00:29:17.756 --> 00:29:19.090
You can't do that.

357
00:29:19.174 --> 00:29:20.341
What-what?

358
00:29:20.842 --> 00:29:24.179
What are you saying?
I can do much better than him!

359
00:29:25.555 --> 00:29:28.808
<i>But this is part of my work as a critic.</i>

360
00:29:28.892 --> 00:29:29.809
What does he drink?

361
00:29:29.893 --> 00:29:33.229
<i>Instead of being condescending</i>
<i>to new directors,</i>

362
00:29:33.313 --> 00:29:35.231
<i>we must tell the truth,</i>

363
00:29:35.315 --> 00:29:38.651
<i>so that they don't relax</i>
<i>and shot the best films...</i>

364
00:29:40.945 --> 00:29:42.363
- Hello.
- Hello.

365
00:29:48.203 --> 00:29:49.287
What is it?

366
00:29:50.371 --> 00:29:51.372
Greetings.

367
00:29:51.873 --> 00:29:56.044
{\an8}I see if this critic
recommended your movie.

368
00:29:56.628 --> 00:29:58.296
And what? Is the movie on the list?

369
00:29:59.547 --> 00:30:00.465
No, there isn't.

370
00:30:02.509 --> 00:30:05.512
I wouldn't waste time on a list
which is not trusted.

371
00:30:05.595 --> 00:30:08.765
But he is quite popular among young people.

372
00:30:09.808 --> 00:30:10.725
Really?

373
00:30:15.438 --> 00:30:18.441
{\an8}LIVE: INTERVIEW
WITH THE YOUNG CRITIC KO GYOM

374
00:30:18.525 --> 00:30:21.027
Why is he everywhere all of a sudden?

375
00:30:21.110 --> 00:30:23.196
<i>"We must love each other".</i>

376
00:30:23.279 --> 00:30:25.698
<i>This is a new film directed by Lee Ru Ri.</i>

377
00:30:26.324 --> 00:30:28.993
<i>I would describe this film in one word -</i>

378
00:30:29.494 --> 00:30:30.662
<i>"lightness".</i>

379
00:30:32.914 --> 00:30:35.667
My boy! He can speak.

380
00:30:35.750 --> 00:30:39.712
He is literally everywhere. What's going on?

381
00:30:39.796 --> 00:30:41.714
He always craved attention.

382
00:30:41.798 --> 00:30:45.468
But he deserved it
unlike some…

383
00:30:45.552 --> 00:30:49.806
<i>They ask me if I'm single</i>
<i>from birth, because I write harsh reviews.</i>

384
00:30:49.889 --> 00:30:51.182
<i>No, it's not like that.</i>

385
00:30:51.266 --> 00:30:53.643
it hurts more
when you tiptoe next to me

386
00:30:54.352 --> 00:30:56.104
Tiptoe? I?

387
00:30:57.146 --> 00:30:58.731
Of course. What nonsense.

388
00:30:59.232 --> 00:31:00.733
I see right through you

389
00:31:00.817 --> 00:31:03.778
how then
when you pushed Chu Ah into the bar and left.

390
00:31:03.862 --> 00:31:06.948
What? Did I push Chu Ah and leave?

391
00:31:07.031 --> 00:31:08.283
Never.

392
00:31:10.827 --> 00:31:14.330
What were you talking about?

393
00:31:17.166 --> 00:31:18.459
She wants to work with me.

394
00:31:19.043 --> 00:31:21.546
Work? That is?

395
00:31:22.130 --> 00:31:24.549
She asked me to write music for the script.

396
00:31:26.509 --> 00:31:28.595
This girl is something.

397
00:31:28.678 --> 00:31:30.972
Coldness blows from her.

398
00:31:34.601 --> 00:31:36.394
Am I really that pathetic?

399
00:31:38.521 --> 00:31:40.773
Is that why she's offering me a job?

400
00:31:40.857 --> 00:31:43.526
You are exaggerating again.

401
00:31:44.235 --> 00:31:48.072
You are too negative about everything.

402
00:31:48.156 --> 00:31:52.911
Maybe she is genuinely interested
in work with you

403
00:31:52.994 --> 00:31:56.080
Maybe she thought about it for a long time.

404
00:31:58.750 --> 00:31:59.667
Indifferently.

405
00:32:01.586 --> 00:32:04.756
I have not the slightest intention
stand between you

406
00:32:04.839 --> 00:32:07.300
What should I do with you, handsome?

407
00:32:07.383 --> 00:32:08.885
This is your character.

408
00:32:09.427 --> 00:32:10.803
You two…

409
00:32:11.721 --> 00:32:13.139
No, I will be silent.

410
00:32:14.390 --> 00:32:17.393
Wipe the glasses. Time to open up.

411
00:32:44.545 --> 00:32:45.546
God!

412
00:32:47.256 --> 00:32:48.675
can i come in

413
00:32:50.551 --> 00:32:51.386
Of course.

414
00:32:56.724 --> 00:32:59.394
And what did your ex say? Did he agree?

415
00:33:00.561 --> 00:33:03.147
He looked at me like I was crazy and left.

416
00:33:04.065 --> 00:33:06.275
You look I would do the same.

417
00:33:08.236 --> 00:33:10.822
It was necessary to say it differently.

418
00:33:10.905 --> 00:33:12.657
How to convince him?

419
00:33:13.783 --> 00:33:15.535
Does it have to be his music?

420
00:33:16.244 --> 00:33:17.954
I wrote the script thinking about him.

421
00:33:19.122 --> 00:33:21.374
What if I don't like it?

422
00:33:22.625 --> 00:33:24.711
You will like it.

423
00:33:26.754 --> 00:33:28.589
You are too confident.

424
00:33:29.090 --> 00:33:31.634
His time just hasn't come yet.

425
00:33:32.135 --> 00:33:36.723
I know he will succeed
as a songwriter.

426
00:33:38.474 --> 00:33:42.020
Does he know that you believe in him so much?

427
00:33:48.192 --> 00:33:49.277
That's the problem.

428
00:33:49.986 --> 00:33:53.239
Now people don't communicate.

429
00:33:59.954 --> 00:34:02.623
Are you sure you don't have feelings for him?

430
00:34:03.166 --> 00:34:04.709
It would make the job more difficult.

431
00:34:04.792 --> 00:34:08.421
I have no feelings.
I can say the same about him.

432
00:34:09.547 --> 00:34:11.883
He seems to have a girlfriend.

433
00:34:12.675 --> 00:34:13.926
That's good.

434
00:34:16.804 --> 00:34:20.391
You got rid of that boy
which got on your nerves?

435
00:34:21.559 --> 00:34:24.979
Did you get rid of it? No.
He becomes even more clingy, so I…

436
00:34:28.024 --> 00:34:29.192
Did I tell you?

437
00:34:29.275 --> 00:34:30.526
What?

438
00:34:30.610 --> 00:34:34.113
We shared a lot
civil servant Kim.

439
00:34:36.074 --> 00:34:39.994
Apparently, she said everything
for free Pilates classes.

440
00:34:40.078 --> 00:34:41.954
So what? say

441
00:34:42.038 --> 00:34:43.372
Not today.

442
00:34:43.456 --> 00:34:45.625
Tell me! I will give you
free pilates lessons.

443
00:34:45.708 --> 00:34:48.044
As? You are not a pilates instructor.

444
00:34:48.127 --> 00:34:50.546
I will teach Do you want me to teach you?

445
00:34:50.630 --> 00:34:52.215
Well, I…

446
00:34:52.298 --> 00:34:54.467
Do you want it or not?

447
00:34:56.594 --> 00:35:00.223
<i>The whole town is talking about him.</i>
<i>Greet film critic Ko Gyom.</i>

448
00:35:00.306 --> 00:35:01.808
<i>Greetings, I'm Ko Gyum.</i>

449
00:35:01.891 --> 00:35:04.310
<i>Your articles are attention grabbing.</i>

450
00:35:04.393 --> 00:35:08.189
You harshly criticized Koo Yeon Sik's film.

451
00:35:08.773 --> 00:35:10.149
Are you ready for the consequences?

452
00:35:10.691 --> 00:35:13.861
I am responsible for every written word.

453
00:35:13.945 --> 00:35:16.197
What disappointed you the most about the film?

454
00:35:16.280 --> 00:35:19.075
Sir, can you turn up the volume?

455
00:35:19.158 --> 00:35:19.992
Of course.

456
00:35:20.076 --> 00:35:25.331
<i>I don't care how the movie ends:</i>
<i>happy or sad.</i>

457
00:35:25.414 --> 00:35:29.418
But convert the film
with such a vague ending

458
00:35:29.502 --> 00:35:32.922
as a means of educating the audience -
it's irresponsible.

459
00:35:34.006 --> 00:35:36.175
<i>A rude remark.</i>

460
00:35:36.259 --> 00:35:38.761
{\an8}<i>I understand why you are called</i>
<i>"public critic"...</i>

461
00:35:38.845 --> 00:35:39.679
{\an8}FILM CRITIC KO GYOM

462
00:35:39.762 --> 00:35:41.931
{\an8}…<i>and why the public loves you.</i>

463
00:35:42.431 --> 00:35:46.686
{\an8}<i>I believe that the critic is obliged</i>
<i>write accurate reviews for viewers.</i>

464
00:35:47.270 --> 00:35:49.313
{\an8}<i>I write critical reviews,</i>

465
00:35:49.397 --> 00:35:52.900
{\an8}<i>but I also talk about good cinema,</i>
<i>which could not be noticed,</i>

466
00:35:52.984 --> 00:35:55.987
<i>because it is not considered entertaining.</i>

467
00:35:56.696 --> 00:35:58.281
<i>It is a sword sharpened at both ends,</i>

468
00:35:58.364 --> 00:36:01.450
<i>but critics are needed by those</i>
<i>who makes movies, otherwise...</i>

469
00:36:01.534 --> 00:36:02.910
It is dangerous.

470
00:36:09.000 --> 00:36:10.084
I said.

471
00:36:10.668 --> 00:36:13.171
You have achieved success very quickly.

472
00:36:13.671 --> 00:36:16.007
I don't care about success.

473
00:36:16.757 --> 00:36:18.926
Will I now have more orders?

474
00:36:19.010 --> 00:36:22.555
You should attend more events
as long as people are interested.

475
00:36:24.807 --> 00:36:28.060
You are eloquent.
You have more stardom than I thought.

476
00:36:30.271 --> 00:36:31.981
Don't stop there.

477
00:36:32.940 --> 00:36:33.774
Of course.

478
00:36:34.817 --> 00:36:37.069
I will take my stardom and leave.

479
00:36:50.374 --> 00:36:51.751
Since when are you so busy?

480
00:36:51.834 --> 00:36:54.045
You are literally everywhere.

481
00:36:54.128 --> 00:36:58.758
I don't like it, but I have to, because they invite me.

482
00:36:58.841 --> 00:37:00.801
Of course. You like attention.

483
00:37:00.885 --> 00:37:03.721
I get paid well.
I will tolerate unwanted attention.

484
00:37:05.139 --> 00:37:07.892
Of course. Make money my friend.

485
00:37:11.646 --> 00:37:14.315
You've been kind of sad lately.

486
00:37:14.398 --> 00:37:16.359
Problems with writing music?

487
00:37:17.568 --> 00:37:18.402
Just…

488
00:37:19.695 --> 00:37:22.615
I knew I was miserable
but made sure once more.

489
00:37:22.698 --> 00:37:24.033
did you know

490
00:37:28.996 --> 00:37:32.750
Chu Ah started writing scripts,
and they even made a movie.

491
00:37:32.833 --> 00:37:37.004
You used to hang out on film sets,
and now you earn from it.

492
00:37:37.755 --> 00:37:38.673
And me?

493
00:37:40.675 --> 00:37:41.676
what am i doing

494
00:37:46.973 --> 00:37:47.974
Time to give up?

495
00:37:49.684 --> 00:37:51.811
When I started writing music, I thought

496
00:37:52.353 --> 00:37:56.482
what will i know
do I have a knack and when should I quit everything?

497
00:37:57.400 --> 00:38:00.736
But this ship has sailed.

498
00:38:04.156 --> 00:38:07.535
Now I'm a fool who doesn't realize
that is not capable of anything.

499
00:38:09.620 --> 00:38:11.038
What a shame.

500
00:38:18.129 --> 00:38:20.256
Are you crying?

501
00:38:23.217 --> 00:38:26.304
Thank God. Because it became almost embarrassing.

502
00:38:26.387 --> 00:38:28.180
Stop talking stupid and drink.

503
00:38:28.264 --> 00:38:29.098
You said it yourself.

504
00:38:29.181 --> 00:38:32.184
Enough bullshit, just do your thing.

505
00:38:33.394 --> 00:38:36.397
Everyone has their own breakthrough.

506
00:38:38.024 --> 00:38:40.109
And you were always the best of us.

507
00:38:41.986 --> 00:38:42.945
I do not object.

508
00:38:46.073 --> 00:38:46.907
Cheers.

509
00:38:51.829 --> 00:38:53.331
{\an8}25TH FRAME

510
00:38:53.414 --> 00:38:54.749
How did it happen?

511
00:38:55.333 --> 00:38:58.336
Such Is he all right?

512
00:38:58.419 --> 00:38:59.587
I don't know.

513
00:39:00.379 --> 00:39:02.840
Are we not responsible?

514
00:39:02.923 --> 00:39:04.258
And don't say!

515
00:39:05.259 --> 00:39:07.261
This is how the day begins.

516
00:39:10.431 --> 00:39:14.185
DIRECTOR KU YON SIK WAS SAVED BY FAMILY
AFTER AN OVERDOSE OF SLEEPING AIDS

517
00:39:24.153 --> 00:39:26.697
KOO YOUNG SIK IN THE HOSPITAL
AFTER THE SUICIDE ATTEMPT

518
00:39:59.939 --> 00:40:03.484
I'm sorry With the director
Is Koo Young Sik ok?

519
00:40:03.567 --> 00:40:06.445
Sort of. His stomach was washed.
He is in the ward.

520
00:40:08.531 --> 00:40:10.199
Where to find it?

521
00:40:10.783 --> 00:40:12.201
Do you know each other?

522
00:40:14.578 --> 00:40:15.413
A minute

523
00:40:17.039 --> 00:40:17.915
This is the critic!

524
00:40:19.166 --> 00:40:20.000
Who is Gyom?

525
00:40:20.084 --> 00:40:20.918
It's him!

526
00:40:21.001 --> 00:40:22.169
- Yes!
- Why are you here?

527
00:40:22.253 --> 00:40:24.922
- Do you feel guilty?
- What do you feel?

528
00:40:26.632 --> 00:40:28.676
- Did you come to apologize?
- Is it true?

529
00:40:28.759 --> 00:40:30.761
- Say something.
- Even a word!

530
00:40:31.679 --> 00:40:33.013
are you sorry

531
00:40:33.097 --> 00:40:34.348
How are you feeling?

532
00:40:34.432 --> 00:40:37.268
Do you think it was because of your review?

533
00:40:40.271 --> 00:40:42.857
- Do you feel sorry for him?
- Say something.

534
00:41:05.796 --> 00:41:07.214
Don't do it here.

535
00:41:07.298 --> 00:41:10.301
My dad needs some rest, you better go.

536
00:41:11.510 --> 00:41:13.762
go You are only making it worse.

537
00:41:15.389 --> 00:41:16.223
OK.

538
00:41:18.517 --> 00:41:19.351
What?

539
00:41:20.394 --> 00:41:23.230
- Is he really leaving?
- What? Mr. Ko, wait a minute!

540
00:41:23.731 --> 00:41:25.399
- Wait!
- Mr. Ko!

541
00:41:26.484 --> 00:41:29.487
THE LINE BETWEEN CRITICISM AND PRIDE
ARE CRITICS ALWAYS RIGHT?

542
00:41:41.499 --> 00:41:43.834
{\an8}I KNEW THAT
INSULTS ARE NOT CRITICISM

543
00:41:43.918 --> 00:41:46.170
{\an8}MUST BE HUMBLE
I HAVE ALWAYS HATED HIM

544
00:41:46.253 --> 00:41:48.672
{\an8}FREEDOM OF SPEECH? FUNNY
CAN CRITICS BE INSULTED?

545
00:42:04.438 --> 00:42:05.272
Here.

546
00:42:06.857 --> 00:42:08.025
Everything is fine.

547
00:42:15.324 --> 00:42:17.952
Why did you go there?
and threw the brush into the fire?

548
00:42:18.035 --> 00:42:19.286
I would rather sit quietly.

549
00:42:20.120 --> 00:42:22.873
I don't know. I didn't think then.

550
00:42:22.957 --> 00:42:27.294
That's right. I said be careful
critics are easy targets.

551
00:42:29.296 --> 00:42:32.758
Director Ku will be fine.

552
00:42:34.301 --> 00:42:35.553
Don't worry.

553
00:42:36.345 --> 00:42:38.180
I guess you already understood.

554
00:42:38.264 --> 00:42:41.892
People don't care when you praise a movie.

555
00:42:42.560 --> 00:42:46.981
But when you say that the movie is a failure,
they flock like flies to honey.

556
00:42:47.064 --> 00:42:51.652
People hide behind critics like you
to shame movies.

557
00:42:51.735 --> 00:42:54.154
And when this happens, they turn away

558
00:42:54.905 --> 00:42:57.575
and looking for a scapegoat.

559
00:42:58.826 --> 00:43:00.494
So don't worry too much.

560
00:43:01.495 --> 00:43:03.831
- Everything is fine with me.
- Are you sure?

561
00:43:04.498 --> 00:43:07.001
Don't read those comments.

562
00:43:07.084 --> 00:43:10.004
There is no need.
My inbox is already full.

563
00:43:10.087 --> 00:43:12.423
Ignore them. Clear?

564
00:43:12.923 --> 00:43:15.634
- Come in!
- Director Kim. Here!

565
00:43:16.385 --> 00:43:17.803
Did you call someone?

566
00:43:17.886 --> 00:43:22.182
I agreed with her first.
And I invited you to comfort you.

567
00:43:22.266 --> 00:43:25.311
You already know each other. The bigger the merrier.

568
00:43:25.394 --> 00:43:28.105
Sit down, director Kim. Beer?

569
00:43:28.606 --> 00:43:30.190
A bottle of beer, please!

570
00:43:30.274 --> 00:43:31.275
What beer?

571
00:43:31.358 --> 00:43:33.861
Any that don't sell well.

572
00:43:33.944 --> 00:43:34.778
Here.

573
00:43:39.700 --> 00:43:42.911
They write about me that I betrayed my country.

574
00:43:42.995 --> 00:43:44.997
- What is it with people?
- Director Ma!

575
00:43:45.080 --> 00:43:47.708
Park Chun Tae! You are still alive.

576
00:43:47.791 --> 00:43:49.376
- Long time no see.
- Yes.

577
00:43:49.460 --> 00:43:50.711
Where did you disappear?

578
00:43:51.295 --> 00:43:54.298
My film was a flop, so I went to bed.

579
00:43:54.381 --> 00:43:57.593
Don't say that. Drink with us.

580
00:43:58.135 --> 00:44:00.471
No, I'm not alone. Another time.

581
00:44:00.554 --> 00:44:01.555
Really? OK.

582
00:44:02.264 --> 00:44:04.308
do you still smoke Let's go smoke.

583
00:44:05.267 --> 00:44:06.935
- Shall we go?
- Yes.

584
00:44:07.561 --> 00:44:08.395
Come on.

585
00:44:08.479 --> 00:44:10.898
- Did you drink a lot?
- Yes.

586
00:44:17.321 --> 00:44:18.155
Is everything good?

587
00:44:19.698 --> 00:44:20.532
And what?

588
00:44:24.662 --> 00:44:28.749
You fry yourself.

589
00:44:29.875 --> 00:44:30.709
Help?

590
00:44:30.793 --> 00:44:33.504
Everything is fine. I am an expert in this.

591
00:44:38.509 --> 00:44:40.678
- Well...
- Are you the critic?

592
00:44:41.470 --> 00:44:44.890
It's you. I'm Kim Yong Woo. Do you remember me?

593
00:44:45.557 --> 00:44:47.142
You wrote a review of my film.

594
00:44:49.269 --> 00:44:51.271
You are the director of the film "Balcony".

595
00:44:53.148 --> 00:44:53.982
Do you remember!

596
00:44:54.983 --> 00:44:56.652
- Of course.
- Really?

597
00:45:03.992 --> 00:45:05.285
Would you like to go for a drink?

598
00:45:16.880 --> 00:45:20.134
do i want a drink
Thank you, I'm not in the mood.

599
00:45:20.843 --> 00:45:22.261
You are funny.

600
00:45:22.344 --> 00:45:23.721
Unbelievable.

601
00:45:25.556 --> 00:45:29.643
You made me look like an idiot
and now offer a drink?

602
00:45:32.896 --> 00:45:35.774
Didn't like my review?

603
00:45:35.858 --> 00:45:39.611
You offended me for no reason.
So what do you think?

604
00:45:40.362 --> 00:45:42.281
You are something.

605
00:45:42.364 --> 00:45:46.827
I guess you have to be cheeky
to write such nonsense.

606
00:45:47.953 --> 00:45:48.787
And…

607
00:45:52.666 --> 00:45:55.753
you drink after
what happened to Mr. Ku?

608
00:45:58.756 --> 00:46:00.716
If he doesn't survive,

609
00:46:02.676 --> 00:46:04.511
it will be on your conscience.

610
00:46:12.895 --> 00:46:14.229
what are you doing Get up.

611
00:46:15.314 --> 00:46:16.148
who are you

612
00:46:16.231 --> 00:46:19.109
None of your business. Get up. Immediately.

613
00:46:33.290 --> 00:46:34.792
You didn't have to listen to him.

614
00:46:35.751 --> 00:46:40.255
It must be difficult for you because of this.
He behaved rudely.

615
00:46:40.339 --> 00:46:42.257
Why is it difficult for me?

616
00:46:43.217 --> 00:46:44.051
What?

617
00:46:44.635 --> 00:46:46.553
Why should it be difficult for me?

618
00:46:47.513 --> 00:46:48.931
I didn't do anything wrong.

619
00:46:50.307 --> 00:46:52.309
It is not my fault that the film is a failure.

620
00:46:53.602 --> 00:46:55.270
Not all movies are successful.

621
00:46:56.438 --> 00:46:58.607
We all experience failures.

622
00:46:58.690 --> 00:47:02.611
It's not in the movie. An injured person.

623
00:47:04.696 --> 00:47:08.700
I know, and I say that it is not my fault.

624
00:47:10.285 --> 00:47:11.537
It's not my fault.

625
00:47:15.707 --> 00:47:17.042
Koh Gome.

626
00:47:17.709 --> 00:47:19.878
I didn't say it was your fault.

627
00:47:19.962 --> 00:47:24.466
People who say that
just looking for the culprit.

628
00:47:26.218 --> 00:47:28.136
Are you of the same opinion?

629
00:47:29.721 --> 00:47:31.265
Do you always twist things?

630
00:47:33.058 --> 00:47:34.893
Do you still want to teach me something?

631
00:47:40.107 --> 00:47:41.191
Kim Mubi.

632
00:47:41.275 --> 00:47:44.611
I am comforting you, not teaching you.
I sympathize, not criticize.

633
00:47:45.487 --> 00:47:47.030
you didn't notice

634
00:47:47.114 --> 00:47:50.284
that Mr. Ma and I were around, taking care of you?

635
00:47:50.993 --> 00:47:53.412
You can pretend it doesn't hurt,

636
00:47:53.912 --> 00:47:55.914
but don't ignore those around you.

637
00:47:59.626 --> 00:48:02.296
You know what pissed me off
when did i meet you again

638
00:48:03.338 --> 00:48:05.757
You only cared about your pain like now.

639
00:48:06.466 --> 00:48:08.719
You are not interested in other people.

640
00:48:17.686 --> 00:48:18.520
VIDE BAR

641
00:49:16.036 --> 00:49:16.870
ok

642
00:49:18.246 --> 00:49:19.414
Let's work together.

643
00:49:23.710 --> 00:49:26.129
I'm betting everything.

644
00:49:28.924 --> 00:49:30.008
And what exactly?

645
00:49:30.092 --> 00:49:31.426
His pride.

646
00:49:34.846 --> 00:49:38.475
Pride that did not want
help from the person I loved.

647
00:49:38.558 --> 00:49:39.768
Si Chun.

648
00:49:39.851 --> 00:49:41.603
I will write something grandiose.

649
00:49:42.980 --> 00:49:44.064
Better than yours.

650
00:50:04.334 --> 00:50:06.003
Mom, I'm leaving.

651
00:50:07.087 --> 00:50:08.171
take this

652
00:50:11.550 --> 00:50:12.551
Good.

653
00:50:17.681 --> 00:50:24.479
KOO YOUNG SIK

654
00:50:36.074 --> 00:50:38.243
You are Mubi, right?

655
00:50:38.910 --> 00:50:40.579
It's okay, don't get up.

656
00:50:42.247 --> 00:50:43.415
You haven't changed.

657
00:50:44.875 --> 00:50:47.044
And you have grown old.

658
00:50:48.211 --> 00:50:49.046
Truth?

659
00:50:49.129 --> 00:50:51.590
Your mother was talking about you.

660
00:50:51.673 --> 00:50:54.176
I was proud that you became a director.

661
00:50:55.260 --> 00:50:56.887
I liked your movie.

662
00:50:57.679 --> 00:51:01.516
Hong Tong would be delighted.

663
00:51:04.394 --> 00:51:06.563
why did you come

664
00:51:06.646 --> 00:51:08.982
What happened to you?

665
00:51:09.483 --> 00:51:10.484
You really…

666
00:51:11.902 --> 00:51:16.448
Everything was wrong.
Journalists twisted everything.

667
00:51:16.531 --> 00:51:17.699
Truth?

668
00:51:17.783 --> 00:51:20.827
I have been for a long time
I can't fall asleep without sleeping pills.

669
00:51:20.911 --> 00:51:22.913
And I have anxiety problems.

670
00:51:23.997 --> 00:51:27.501
I had too much to drink that night
and took pills...

671
00:51:29.711 --> 00:51:32.005
I didn't know it would happen like this.

672
00:51:37.010 --> 00:51:41.431
This job really demands a person
physical and mental health.

673
00:51:41.515 --> 00:51:45.936
are you ok
You have to take care of your health.

674
00:51:46.937 --> 00:51:49.064
I take care of my health to prove

675
00:51:49.147 --> 00:51:52.150
that you can do it without harming yourself.

676
00:51:54.569 --> 00:51:57.906
Your dad always showed you off.

677
00:51:58.865 --> 00:52:01.118
He said you are smart.

678
00:52:02.160 --> 00:52:04.996
If something happened to you,

679
00:52:06.373 --> 00:52:09.459
I would hate the movie.

680
00:52:11.086 --> 00:52:13.755
Why does cinema make people like this?

681
00:52:13.839 --> 00:52:16.466
God I am ashamed.

682
00:52:18.385 --> 00:52:21.346
You must call and start a new project.

683
00:52:21.429 --> 00:52:24.349
I love your movies since childhood.

684
00:52:25.392 --> 00:52:27.310
OK. Thank you.

685
00:52:29.020 --> 00:52:32.190
Rest, I'll go.

686
00:52:33.233 --> 00:52:34.401
I would like to rest

687
00:52:35.152 --> 00:52:36.945
but that guy is restless.

688
00:52:37.821 --> 00:52:40.574
I say it's fine
but he comes every day.

689
00:53:13.023 --> 00:53:14.858
what are you doing here

690
00:53:19.404 --> 00:53:22.115
I'm just waiting.

691
00:53:24.701 --> 00:53:25.619
For what?

692
00:53:31.374 --> 00:53:33.960
For something good to happen again.

693
00:53:47.015 --> 00:53:48.600
And you came again.

694
00:53:51.019 --> 00:53:52.729
<i>I don't want to admit it...</i>

695
00:53:56.441 --> 00:54:00.987
<i>but my weakness is</i>
<i>that I open my heart easily</i>

696
00:54:01.821 --> 00:54:04.157
<i>for the small and unfortunate.</i>

697
00:54:06.451 --> 00:54:07.452
I'm tired.

698
00:54:09.579 --> 00:54:10.413
Yes.

699
00:54:12.123 --> 00:54:13.041
me too

700
00:54:19.756 --> 00:54:26.179
<i>And I'm afraid that Ko Geum is one of those.</i>

701
00:54:32.978 --> 00:54:37.983
LIKE IN THE MOVIE

702
00:54:50.537 --> 00:54:53.290
<i>I'm not too happy,</i>

703
00:54:54.666 --> 00:54:57.502
<i>that Kim Mubi is happiness,</i>
<i>which comes after misfortune.</i>

704
00:55:00.588 --> 00:55:04.259
<i>Because next time and in the future...</i>

705
00:55:23.820 --> 00:55:24.738
Where did he disappear to?

706
00:55:30.994 --> 00:55:33.747
How so? He could wake me up.

707
00:55:34.706 --> 00:55:36.708
I can't believe that he left me.

708
00:55:38.001 --> 00:55:39.002
You scared me.

709
00:55:39.669 --> 00:55:42.005
What is it? I thought you left.

710
00:55:42.088 --> 00:55:44.507
And you don't have to scare people like that.

711
00:55:44.591 --> 00:55:47.135
I thought you were cold, so I went to get a blanket.

712
00:55:47.218 --> 00:55:51.181
You would let me sleep here
and did not send home?

713
00:55:51.264 --> 00:55:54.809
your truth Why didn't I think of that?

714
00:55:56.603 --> 00:55:57.562
I will go

715
00:55:58.146 --> 00:56:01.107
Don't be so pathetic, go home already.

716
00:56:06.196 --> 00:56:07.614
It's annoying.

717
00:56:09.616 --> 00:56:10.450
Mubi.

718
00:56:12.535 --> 00:56:14.329
Did I allow you to call me by my name?

719
00:56:15.872 --> 00:56:18.124
<i>…hope it will always be like that.</i>

720
00:56:23.004 --> 00:56:23.880
I want to…

721
00:56:27.884 --> 00:56:29.219
to like you again

722
00:58:41.809 --> 00:58:44.854
Translation of subtitles: Natalya Kovalyshyn

